# Check every file out exactly as it was committed, on every OS, as the Go
# repository does. Git for Windows (and GitHub's Windows runners) default
# to core.autocrlf=true, which turns the LF line endings of text files into
# CRLF in the working tree: TestGenerated (internal/dct) would then find
# the committed assembly different from what its generators write, and
# the JPEG and PNG test files and golden images must never be rewritten.
* -text

# The test inputs and golden images: no textual diff or merge either.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
